# Everything a sweep WRITES. None of it has ever been tracked, and none of it should be: a results
# directory is one machine's measurement of one preset, so committing it makes the repo the place
# two machines' numbers get silently mixed. Copy the directory off the cluster instead.

# Results, both the current naming (results_<corpus>_<preset>/) and every older one.
results_*/
corpus_perf_results*/
verify_*/
flow_results/

# Generated tables and figures, which the plot scripts write next to the scripts.
*_numpy-reference.md
*_numpy-reference.png
*_seq-cpp.md
*_seq-cpp.png
*_speedup.png
*.log

__pycache__/
